Plan for the repaired script (keeps the strong model, fixes assembly):
- `Preprocessor` (fit-once, pickled) — numeric vs categorical detection, label-encoding with `__NA__` handling done safely via `.where(...)` (not `astype(str).fillna(...)`).
- Leakage-safe OOF `TargetEncoder` for `coupon`, `occupation`, `maritalStatus×has_children`, `coupon×has_children`, `time×coupon`, `income×coupon`.
- 5-fold `StratifiedKFold` OOF to tune blend weight `w` (LGB vs HistGB) and decision threshold **on training rows only**.
- Final 5-seed LGB + HistGB ensemble; everything (preprocessor, TE maps, models, config) persisted under `--model`.
- `predict` loads everything read-only, never refits, writes `row_id,prediction` with original labels.

